{title: Oh, how I love Jesus}
{subtitle: Hymnal 273}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Oh, how I love Jesus.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Oh, how I love Jesus, Oh, how I love Jesus
Oh, how I love Jesus, because He first loved me

{comment: Chorus 2}
To me He is so wonderful, to me He is so wonderful
To me He is so wonderful, To know that Jesus is mine

{comment: Verse 1}
There is a Name I love to hear,
I love to sing its worth
It sounds like music in mine ear,
The sweetest name of earth
